msgstr "NCURSES_GPM_TERMS"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux
msgid ""
"(Linux only)  When I<\\%ncurses> is configured to use the GPM interface, "
"this variable may list one or more terminal names against which the I<TERM> "
